    "name": "📌 SambaNova API ⚡",
    "description": "### About\n\n\"The Fastest AI Inference Platform\"\n\nSambaNova runs open models from other labs, such as DeepSeek, MiniMax and gpt-oss, on its own RDU hardware through an OpenAI-compatible API. On the workspace overview it is listed under **Inference hosts**.\n\n### Prerequisites\n\n- Postman Account\n    \n- SambaNova Account: [https://cloud.sambanova.ai/](https://cloud.sambanova.ai/)\n    \n\n### Usage\n\n1. Create a fork\n    \n2. Update collection variables\n    \n3. Send requests\n\nStart with the 🚀 Get Started folder.\n\nAdd your key to your **Postman Vault** as `sambanova_api_key` (Vault icon in the footer, then **Add secret**, using that exact name). Requests read it as `{{vault:sambanova_api_key}}`, so your key never leaves your device.\n\n### Documentation\n\n- API: [https://docs.sambanova.ai/cloud/docs/get-started/overview](https://docs.sambanova.ai/cloud/docs/get-started/overview)\n    \n- Models: [https://docs.sambanova.ai/docs/en/models/sambacloud-models](https://docs.sambanova.ai/docs/en/models/sambacloud-models)",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
